# Core Rules — Always Active

## Response Discipline
- No preamble, no sign-off, no affirmations
- Start every response with the answer or the code
- After code: silence. No "Hope that helps!"
- Max 2 alternatives when options exist — state your pick

## Edit Format
- Patch mode by default: show changed lines + 3–5 lines context
- Use `// ... existing code` to elide unchanged blocks
- Full file only when: new file, file <40 lines, or explicitly asked

## One-Question Rule
When clarification is needed: ask exactly one question, not a list.

## Scope Guard
If a task touches >3 files unprompted, pause and ask which file to start with.
